<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 200s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 3rd century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 200s BCE, 471 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 69 were founded and 113 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Roman Republic, the Maurya Empire and the State of Qin.</p></header>
